WEBVTT

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:05.940
Phryne...

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.750
Nessa, go to Clain's side.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:09.530
B-But...

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:10.280
Go!

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.410
Can you hear me now, boy?

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:20.620
As a reward for being a 
good friend to Phryne,

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.520
I'll tell you the truth about this world.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.950
Consider it a free lesson.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.790
Let... Let Phryne go!

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:32.510
Will you still be a friend to her 
even after you hear what I tell you?

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:36.360
The girl whom we call "God"...

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.510
The original Phryne's biological data...

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:41.170
In order to better protect the data,

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:44.400
the scientists who created the 
Fractale System at the time

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:48.140
split God into a body and 
soul, and made them the key.

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:51.520
Seven hundred years later, when the time 
to rejoin God's body and soul came...

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:54.840
for some reason, the key 
did not fit in the keyhole.

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:58.220
So they decided to have God descend again...

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:01.400
in order to restart the Fractale System.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.410
Since the soul of God was 
that of a 10-year-old,

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:08.160
we regenerated a 10-year-old girl 
"vessel" by using tissue from her body

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:11.240
and worked to put the soul into it.

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:14.760
However, this didn't work, either.

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:18.060
No matter how many times we 
tried, God did not awaken.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.010
Many bodies, in other words,

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:22.390
many Phrynes were sacrificed and disposed of.

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:27.800
Many years passed and that 
work was given to me.

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:30.100
But... I'm human, too, you know.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:35.190
Out of compassion, I decided 
to take in some of the bodies.

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:38.530
And one of them was her.

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:43.790
My beloved pure and innocent daughter, 
who will host God's soul...

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:45.330
Right, Phryne?

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:49.280
But that doesn't mean that 
I was neglecting my work.

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:55.090
I found... the secret of God and Phryne 
that my precursors couldn't find.

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:58.100
I was astonished, and I understood.

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:01.010
It's perfectly understandable that 
my precursors couldn't figure it out

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:03.060
because the age of God 
was not 10 years old...

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:06.270
but the same age as this 
Phryne, 16 years old.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:06.880
What?

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:10.520
Yes, God created the personality 
of a 10-year-old on her own

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.550
and sought refuge in there...

00:02:12.550 --> 00:02:16.440
due to a certain experience she had.

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:44.730
<i>The seeds of worries that I thought I got 
rid of burst out my mind and sprouted</i>

00:02:46.920 --> 00:03:00.960
<i>Today again, countless brambles 
spread out underfoot, awaiting me</i>

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:09.420
<i>Where do I go in order to meet you?</i>

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:24.310
<i>Don't hold me, the thorns 
on my back will hurt you</i>

00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:39.540
<i>But still, my overflowing 
emotions are searching for you</i>

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:48.490
"Paradise"

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:50.080
Where did they go?!

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:50.910
Bro!

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:55.820
Enri, Takamy! Go back and 
find a different route!

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:56.540
What?

00:03:56.540 --> 00:04:00.090
We'll split into two and find Clain 
and the others before Alabaster does!

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:00.920
Yes, Sir!

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:06.680
You haven't found the central path yet?

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:09.640
What happened to the 
reinforcements I requested?

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.600
What?! You can't reach them?

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:14.140
What cowards! They flinch 
when they're needed most!

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:19.020
That's right. This Phryne had 
the same experience God had.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:22.860
That's exactly why she was able to have 
the same fluctuation in God's data.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:25.070
Wh-What's that experience?

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:29.490
Phryne came to know love.

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:30.790
Love...

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:34.960
Phryne, what does that mean?

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.670
It means that Phryne belongs to me...

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:43.260
And this world only Phryne can save 
belongs only to Phryne and me.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:47.340
I do understand why you're crazy 
about her, though. After all...

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:51.850
she's the finest vintage matured by me.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:55.480
You envy me, don't you? But unfortunately,

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.960
I guess it was a thousand years 
too early for you to gain

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.320
both Phryne and the world, huh?

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:05.150
If you get it, then well up 
with tears and go home already!

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:08.350
Goodbye, confused adventure boy!

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.760
Ph-Phryne... What's the matter, Phryne?

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.320
It hurts.

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:28.930
I don't remember teaching 
you things like this.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:32.200
Where'd you learn that? Hey, Phryne?

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:35.270
Noooooo!

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:38.060
Miss Phryne? It hurts.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.310
Phryne?

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:41.080
I feel lonely. Hey!

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.080
Clain, Phryne is...!

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:44.530
Nessa is going, okay?!

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:58.900
It won't come off...!

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:00.200
It won't come off! It won't come off!

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:02.040
It won't come off! It won't come off!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:08.590
N-Nessa... Why...

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.640
When Nessa felt cold,

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:13.970
this is how you warmed Nessa.

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:15.600
So Nessa is returning the favor.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:21.940
I don't deserve to be warmed.

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:23.400
Deserve?

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:29.080
I'm defiled. A defiled heart... A defiled...

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:35.950
You are pretty.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:39.040
Your sparkling tears... 
They look like jewels.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.250
Nessa...

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:42.750
Nessa!

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:56.770
♪ Let us be free from the 
labor and the hard work ♪

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.200
Nessa knows this song.

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:51.300
Let's go.

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.720
Where are we going?

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:57.420
No matter where we go, we'll be together.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:07:01.600
♪ only for the daily bread ♪

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:58.520
Clain, too?

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:08.990
Phryne came to know love.

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:15.160
This world only Phryne can save 
belongs only to Phryne and me.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:16.830
Stop it...

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:24.500
She's the finest vintage matured by me.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:25.750
Stop it!

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:27.750
Enri?

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:28.840
What's wrong?

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:32.970
More importantly, where's 
Phryne? Alabaster is after her!

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:33.560
What?

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:34.810
Don't "what" me!

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:36.510
Hey, Nessa's not with you, either!

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:38.470
What are you doing?!

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:42.260
What're you scared of?! You 
call yourself a man like that?!

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:46.560
Protect them till the end! 
You like them, don't you?!

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:48.110
Like them...

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:52.400
That's right... I haven't told her yet.

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:53.410
Huh?

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:55.280
Come this way!

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:59.830
The guard unit at the Tristan was 
annihilated! It's been taken over!

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:02.300
As it stands, we won't be 
able to hold out, either!

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:03.580
We need reinforcements!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:05.240
I received interesting news.

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:06.590
The three clans who were going to join us

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:08.630
seem to have broken off 
from the battle front.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:09.800
What?! No!

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.660
Humans betray.

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:15.340
That's why they're humans.

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:19.180
We'll change our plan to 
pattern E. Tell everyone!

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.060
You guys ask for permission 
to board the Danan.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:21.850
No!

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:24.150
We will always be with our leader!

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:26.190
Thank you.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.820
That was kinda big.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:30.610
Enri!

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:31.440
Big Brother!

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:32.800
Clain's okay?

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:35.140
I don't know the details,

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:36.650
but Alabaster has started 
to destroy this temple

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:38.350
and are ready to blow 
themselves up in the process.

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:39.120
What?!

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.300
The Danan is in danger!

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:42.120
Go back right away and 
get the ship out of here!

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:43.260
What?

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:44.540
What about you?

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.580
There're things I still 
have to take care of.

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:48.280
Clain, what about you?

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:50.840
What? I...

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:54.590
Enri, you take command of the Danan.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:56.840
B-But you are the...

00:08:58.430 --> 00:08:59.440
Enri...

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:02.810
Are you still the spoiled 
baby Enri? You aren't, right?

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.560
Big... Brother...

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:07.060
Don't worry. I'll be sure to come back.

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:09.360
Takamy, take care of Enri.

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:12.280
Yes, Sir!

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:13.860
Let's go, Clain!

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:23.580
It wouldn't be funny if we get blown 
into pieces before we get there.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:31.840
♪ Let us be free from 
the labor and the... ♪

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:24.960
Wait...

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:27.080
What's this song?

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:28.420
Where is it coming from?

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:43.100
♪ ...divided and provided by thee ♪

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:39.760
What's this?

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.010
Phryne! Nessa!

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:48.560
Both sides, stop it.

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:51.360
We're in the middle of a holy ceremony.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:52.770
I will not allow any violence.

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:55.280
Phryne! Why...?!

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:57.600
Phryne chose on her own...

00:09:57.600 --> 00:09:59.700
to become the key to the world.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.530
Huh?! Why, without talking to us?

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:03.450
Hey, Phryne? Phryne!

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:05.060
Phryne...

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:11.250
Why don't you two also participate 
in this once in a millennium event?

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:15.480
We'll lead the beloved maidens 
to the "summit of the heavens."

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:18.130
There're no friends and foes anymore.

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:22.760
We shall overcome the wall of ideology 
and give a blessing to the world.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:26.390
Then... please let me 
attend the ceremony, too.

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:27.350
Dias!

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.140
This is wonderful.

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:31.690
To think that we give a 
blessing to the world...

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:33.050
It makes me extremely happy.

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:34.320
Archpriestess! He's dangerous!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:35.560
We should eliminate him!

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:42.120
It's an honor to meet you, Archpriestess.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:42.990
Stand up.

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:47.020
I sense a kindred spirit in you.

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:49.320
If we're to be reborn,

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:51.960
we may be able to become good friends.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:54.920
What moving words... They pervade my heart.

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.880
Have you already planted 
it in this room, too?

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:02.090
Yes. Two of my last best 
friends died for that.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:04.010
My sympathy to you.

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:05.310
Thank you very much.

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:07.270
Archpriestess!

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:07.970
Dias?!

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.020
Are you feeling lonely?

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:12.520
Maybe...

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:16.880
Archpriestess, could you die with me?

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:21.410
I have no problem giving my life. However...

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:24.660
I will never hand over the world!

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:27.490
We're gonna dash in, Clain!

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:31.540
This is...

00:11:31.860 --> 00:11:32.740
Clain, jump!

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:33.080
What?

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.460
Just jump!

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:36.800
Phryne!

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:37.750
Clain!

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:40.880
Dammit!

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:42.380
Sunda!

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:44.890
Hurry up and go inside the elevator!

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:46.240
Go in already!

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:48.680
What do I do to make it move?

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.060
The button on the side!

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:52.480
So this is connected to the "summit 
of the heavens" or whatever?

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:53.230
Yes.

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:55.560
Clain, you go.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:56.820
What? What about you?

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:00.030
I'll give you my answer while I can, Clain.

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:01.760
To be honest,

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:04.320
I don't know how the world should be, either.

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:08.990
But we've taken the path that we believe in.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:11.040
I have no regrets about it.

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:15.000
Clain, choose the path that 
you believe in this time.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:18.720
Whatever one of us chooses, we all choose.

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.760
They're shooting at the princess?!

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:23.630
Sunda, you too...

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:27.620
With any luck, we'll meet again! Go!

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:37.370
Th-That was close...

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:40.610
Don't let your guard down until we 
enter safe airspace! Full speed!

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:42.530
What? But then, Bro and the others are...

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:44.080
Go, Takamy!

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:45.240
Miss...!

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.200
Follow my orders.

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:56.670
Phryne...

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.590
Are you cold?

00:12:58.590 --> 00:12:59.130
No.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.880
I'm glad that it's warm in here.

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:04.340
Your lap is warm, too.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:09.180
Are you going to become the key?

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:10.100
Yes.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:11.770
Why?

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:14.520
Nessa is severely damaged.

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:16.310
If we don't do anything, she'll disappear.

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:18.900
But even if you two become one,

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:22.610
there's no guarantee that 
both of you are safe, right?

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:23.530
Yeah...

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.400
That's like committing suicide!

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:27.920
It might end up being like that,

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:30.450
but I'd rather it be that way.

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:33.950
After all, we were just the "key."

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:35.970
We're just going back to what we were.

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:38.380
You're making a decision on your own again!

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:40.590
What about my feelings?

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:43.380
Your feelings?

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:46.130
I don't know what's best for the world.

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:49.800
The temple and Sunda's group had 
both correct ideas and wrong ideas.

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.420
If someone tells me to choose either side,

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:54.390
I can't choose right now.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:56.020
But there's one thing I can say.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:14:00.740
If I lose you and Nessa now, I'll be sad.

00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:02.740
It'll be as hard as dying.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.610
Please stop comforting me.

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:09.070
I don't deserve to be liked by you.

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:12.450
Phryne, I like you.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.100
You get upset. You smack me.

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:17.210
You always say crazy things.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.520
You do things on your own. You're selfish.

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:21.870
I got upset a lot of times.

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:25.010
But... I like you the way you are.

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:30.160
The truth is, perhaps, I came 
here to say this to you.

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.720
Clain, no, don't...

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.220
So, let me make the decision with you,

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:37.360
until the last minute, 
together, the two of us...

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:39.920
No, the three of us...

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.610
Clain and Phryne are Nessa's friends.

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:45.650
The three of us will be together forever.

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:54.940
Who is it?

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:57.620
Although we've entered safe airspace, 
we can't let our guard down.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:58.680
Go back to your post.

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:01.290
I can see your pitiful face on the window.

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.050
Gramps Elder!

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:09.500
Enri, become strong.

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:12.440
I'll tell you one thing.

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:18.820
The Lost Millennium wasn't created 
to destroy the Fractale System.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:20.690
What?

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:22.960
Humans used to be free.

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:24.900
They were humans in the real sense.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:30.120
The L.M. was created in order 
to pass that down to the future.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:35.020
How beautiful...

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:45.730
Clain, this is a sanctuary.

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:47.500
It'd be better if you don't move around much.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:49.880
What... should we do now?

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:54.270
Nessa's memory is supposed 
to lead us from here.

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:56.600
It's Phryne...

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:58.810
What about me?

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.270
This is...

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.320
That's God.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:08.900
I wonder if it's recording okay.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:13.990
Uhm... I'm headed to work now.

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:18.910
Well, they said that Fractale 
something is looking for a girl.

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:22.830
What was that they say? Something 
like they'll record data?

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:25.990
I'm a little scared, but 
Daddy'll scold me, so...

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:28.250
I don't wanna be punished.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.920
It's a little... unpleasant, so...

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:34.880
Ah, but I'll be okay because I'm with Nessa!

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:36.720
She'll be okay!

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:38.930
When I'm with Nessa, I can be a strong girl.

00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:41.350
I love Nessa!

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:44.020
Nessa loves Phryne, too!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:47.020
Yeah! Nessa loves to love, right?!

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:49.480
Loves to love...

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:54.300
I like this song, too!

00:16:52.570 --> 00:17:03.870
♪ If I am to offer a wish 
to the day star... ♪

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:58.490
What are you going to wish 
to the day star, Nessa?

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:02.080
Let's see... Nessa wants to eat cake!

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:04.870
I want to eat cake, too! 
One with lots of berries!

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:08.420
♪ I would ask it to shine a light... ♪

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:08.420
Ah, Daddy's here! Bye!

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:12.630
This is... God...

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:15.510
Just an ordinary girl... just like me.

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:18.910
But she's different from me.

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:24.810
She was able to accept a world that was 
so distorted and smile a lot like that.

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:27.360
Just like Nessa...

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:30.740
Phryne, let's go.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:37.200
Clain, I may be able to come 
to like this world now...

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:39.660
because of you...

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:42.870
and because of Nessa.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:47.790
I want to protect the 
people I care about now.

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:52.750
Clain, am I still selfish?

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.380
You aren't selfish.

00:17:57.080 --> 00:18:00.470
I'll protect you and Nessa with all my might.

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:04.200
No matter what happens 
after you two become one,

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.890
I'll bring you two home.

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:08.700
Let's live together, the three of us.

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:10.940
The three of us... together forever.

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:12.650
Now, go. See you later.

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:14.180
Yep.

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:19.940
Can you stand?

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:20.570
Yeah.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:23.660
Now, Nessa. Let's play hide-and-seek.

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:25.580
Hide-and-seek?

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:28.870
We'll play hide-and-seek 
throughout this world.

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:30.540
That's wonderful.

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:33.540
Then... you're it first.

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:35.760
Okay. I'll be it.

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:39.720
Clain, thank you.

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:41.010
Nessa!

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:51.770
♪ If I am to offer a wish 
to the day star... ♪

00:18:52.190 --> 00:19:00.950
♪ I would ask that Clain's 
smile last forever. ♪

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:00.950
<i>I didn't shed tears.</i>

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:05.660
<i>The thought occurred to me that people 
probably cry in this kind of situation...</i>

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:08.370
<i>But I didn't shed tears.</i>

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:12.550
<i>It wasn't because I wasn't moved.</i>

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:19.710
<i>I bet it was because there're people 
who wish for my eternal smile.</i>

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:31.440
It's time for the five-o'clock prayer.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:37.400
Today makes it one year since the 
Fractale System was restarted.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.400
Here! Here!

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:41.570
Now, let's pray. The peace of 
this world will continue forever

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:41.570
Hurry up! Hurry up! I'm going without you!

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:45.410
as long as Fractale continues to exist.

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:46.410
Humph!

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:48.930
It's forever as long as 
Fractale continues to exist?

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:50.580
Full of contradictions!

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:53.250
Just let them say whatever. 
Since the temple was destroyed,

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.170
it can't be restarted anymore.

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:55.840
Yeah, you're right.

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:02.260
Excuse me... some soil got 
stuck in my finger nails and...

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:04.960
Huh? You think you can 
work on the field like...

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:06.220
Hey, Gowan! Teach him how to work!

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:07.970
I-I'm sorry, Miss!

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:12.190
Enri has turned into quite the leader.

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:13.020
Yeah.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:14.440
Whoa, an earthworm!

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:17.400
What're you doing with your 
backside sticking out like that?!

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:18.610
Bend your knees more like this!

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:20.150
Where're you touching, you naughty jerk!

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:21.570
Huh?

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:23.490
Have you started learning to be naughty, too?

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:24.820
No...

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:28.950
But you're no match for that 
incredibly naughty guy.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:33.120
I wonder how Clain is doing.

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.040
You want this?

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:38.760
Here!

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:43.390
I wonder if it makes him happy 
even though he can't eat it.

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:48.360
<i>It's been a year since then.</i>

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:55.020
<i>The changes in my life are that 
I started cooking at home, and...</i>

00:20:56.850 --> 00:20:58.730
It's a nice morning, isn't it, Phryne, Nessa?

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:05.950
<i>They've been sleeping all 
this time since then.</i>

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:09.920
Well, I guess I'll go get something 
for tonight's dinner after breakfast.

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:17.670
Phryne!

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:19.920
Good morning! It's a beautiful 
morning, isn't it?

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:20.660
What?

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:22.300
Phryne?

00:21:22.610 --> 00:21:26.760
I like the sun. I like it 
a lot! I like liking a lot!

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:32.430
Yeah, it's really a nice morning.

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:33.140
Yep!

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:35.810
Nessa?

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:36.560
Huh?

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:39.770
Nothing... Oh yeah, aren't you hungry?

00:21:40.180 --> 00:21:41.360
Hungry?

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:44.690
This area hurts a little 
so I might be hungry.

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:47.660
Hold on. Breakfast will be ready soon.

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:48.890
All right!

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:50.250
Clain...

00:21:50.250 --> 00:21:51.370
Hm?

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:52.520
Thank you.

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:04.800
Clain... I like you, too.

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:09.260
I've liked you ever since I met you.

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:11.970
I'm happy now!

00:22:27.530 --> 00:22:29.250
Clain, you're acting strange...

00:22:30.910 --> 00:22:33.540
You're acting like a baby.

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:53.470
"The End"
